3: Spec: ./SPEC.md
4: Goal: In the production messaging drawer, no message a user sends is lost or duplicated across network and Realtime 
outages, reloads, several tabs, account changes, and several devices; typing, unread/read state, and @mention 
notifications stay live and correct; and messaging health is observable through redacted logs â€” without regressing 
existing messaging.
5: Plan version: 3
6: Highest task ID reserved: T27
7: Replanned because: PLAN adversarial re-review r2 (`reviews/sol-review-plan-r2.md`, revision required: 3 partial r1 
findings, 4 new) â€” before any execution; v2 preserved as `reviews/PLAN-v2-reviewed.md`.
